    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 105 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present to market No 9 Woodbrook Court. This is a stunning 3 bedroom duplex just located just off the Porterstown Road, and offers a bright and spacious living accommodation throughout. \n\nThe property briefly comprises entrance hallway that leads to a generous open-plan living and dining area. The room features large glass double doors, flooding the space with natural light and providing access to a private terrace ideal for al fresco dining or entertaining guests. The separate shaker-style kitchen is well-appointed, while the three generously sized double bedrooms (with the master benefiting from an ensuite) ensure comfort and privacy. The family bathroom completes the internal accommodation.\n\nWoodbrook Court is surrounded by a host of amenities including schools, bars, restaurants, sports facilities and numerous shops, while both Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and Castleknock Village are just a short drive away. The No. 37 bus to the city centre stops just outside the development and Coolmine train station is just a short stroll away. The M50 and M3 are located close by, creating easy access for commuting around Dublin and beyond. Ideal for first time buyers or anyone looking to downsize in the area.\n\nViewing is recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.67m (5'6\") x 1.32m (4'4\")\nwith carpet floor, intercom phone, alarm panel\n\nLounge - 4.16m (13'8\") x 5m (16'5\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature fireplace with timber surround, gas fire inset. Double doors to the sunny terrace overlooking the communal gardens\n\nDiningroom - 2.54m (8'4\") x 3.11m (10'2\")\nwith laminate flooring\n\nKitchen - 2.44m (8'0\") x 2.73m (8'11\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan.\n\nLanding - 3.18m (10'5\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.65m (12'0\") x 4.7m (15'5\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes, access onto a sunny terrace\n\nEnsuite - 1.09m (3'7\") x 1.75m (5'9\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., shower cubicle with pumped shower, tiled flooring, partially tiled walls\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.42m (11'3\") x 4.86m (15'11\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.18m (10'5\") x 3.84m (12'7\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.59m (5'3\") x 2.86m (9'5\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment, tiled flooring, partially tiled walls\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas fired central heating </li><li> Private south facing balconies </li><li> Communal parking/secure underground car parking </li><li> Close to bus and train </li><li> Excellent Location </li><li> Chain Free Sale </li><li> Management Fee 2,100</li></ul>"
      },
